{
  "changelog": "- Initial release of geoskill-monsoon-analysis.\n- Diagnoses monsoon systems using wind-field and precipitation time series.\n- Computes three key metrics: seasonal wind reversal and monsoon index, precipitation concentration, and monsoon onset/retreat dates.\n- Supports both East Asia and South Asia regions via the `--region` option.\n- Works with both real wind field raster inputs and synthetic offline data.\n- Outputs monsoon index and diagnostics as GeoTIFFs and JSON files.\n- Designed to run fully offline, protecting user privacy.",
